<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in moderate trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 47.39 to 7333.55, a new record closing high.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.05 to 437.65, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.20.</p>
<p>Winners outnumbered losers 1280 to 1165.</p>
<p>Volume was 458,142,630 compared with 498,746,800 on Wednesday.</p>
